'''Coffin Zoge''' (ヒツギイヌ, ''Hitsugi Inu'', '''Coffin Dog''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Wall Doge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. It was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

