|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[Greeter at the Gates|Sub-chapter 36 - Greeter at the Gates]]<br>'''CotC''': [[Darararah (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Chapter 2 - Darararah Outbreak]]
